    "type": "SUFFIX",
    "direction": "V→N",
    "derives": "ACTION_NOUN",
    "notes": "Stem-final /t/ or /d/ often deleted; -ate verbs → -ation; -ise/-ize → -isation/-ization",
    "examples": "educate→education, decide→decision, create→creation, compete→competition"
